Radar Sweep Documentary demo · Catching the Moon 《狂风里接住登月直播》 · third-party assets and sources

## Voice
- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), voice bm_lewis, speed 0.82, Apache License 2.0; run locally via kokoro-onnx (MIT) through the
  library's core/tts/tts.py. Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT; OpenAI Whisper weights, MIT). Script: demo/vo/lines.json.

## Music samples (CC0; credit not required, given with thanks)
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner): contrabass, cellos, violins, violins_trem, timpani
- Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios): vibraphone, vibraphone_bowed, glockenspiel, harp
  (core/audio/sampler.py). Wind, rain, sonar pings, motors, gears, the alarm bell, the TV hiss and the room tone are
